\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Christ is risen! Hallelujah!
\par Risen our victorious Head.
\par Sing His praises! Hallelujah!
\par Christ is risen from the dead.
\par Gratefully our hearts adore Him,
\par As His light once more appears,
\par Bowing down in joy before Him,
\par Rising up from grief and tears.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Christ is risen! Hallelujah!
\par Risen our victorious Heads.
\par Sing His praise! Hallelujah!
\par Christ is risen from the dead.
\par 
\par 2 Christ is risen! All the sadness
\par Of His earthly life is o'er, 
\par Through the open gate of gladness
\par He returned to life once more;
\par Death and hell before Him bending,
\par He doth rise, the Victor now,
\par Angels on His steps attending,
\par Glory round His wounded brow.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Christ is risen! Hallelujah!
\par Risen our victorious Heads.
\par Sing His praise! Hallelujah!
\par Christ is risen from the dead.
\par 
\par 3 Christ is risen henceforth never 
\par Death or hell shall us enthrall,
\par We are Christ's, in Him for ever 
\par We have triumphed over all;
\par All the doubting and dejection
\par Of our trembling hearts have ceased;
\par 'Tis His day of resurrection,
\par Let us rise and keep the feast.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Christ is risen! Hallelujah!
\par Risen our victorious Heads.
\par Sing His praise! Hallelujah!
\par Christ is risen from the dead.
\par \f1 
